    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d408-a3">

                <pb facs="0516" n="436" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg436"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The mayor of Bamberg to Mr.
                            Bardel</hi>.</head>
                <p>I send the above for your knowledge, and wish to add that the royal Bavarian
                    district attorney will make public the reward so offered.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Bamberg</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-07-02">July 2, 1902</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Brandt</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >First Mayor</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lochner</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >Secretary</hi>.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
